    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bahangi balomolomo koolomiwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gūnizīīla hangī ū mhayo go ng'wa Seeba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'wana wa munhū, bahangīlage a bahangi ba Isilaeli abo bakūhangaga. Bawīlage abo bakūhangaga kūfuma mu maganiko gabo dūhū; būhaya, Gwigwagi ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya, Balī mu kwihīga a bahangi a bachilū chilū, abo bakalondeelaga myoyo yabo dūhū alīyo ndūhū īsho bakabonaga! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee Isilaeli, a bahangi bako babange gītī nyamhawa mu misaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutaalī ū kwīyeleela ī ndugu na kwīchiba ūmo īkambagūkile īdaame, ī numba ya Isilaeli īlabize na būdūla bo kūwīmīla ū būlūgū ū mu lūshikū lwa ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shakoolechiwa shabo sha nyalomolomo, nū būchūja wabo wa kūlembagūla banhū. Nūūlū atabatūmile ū SEEBA bakahayaga, “Ū SEEBA alīhaya gīkī na gīkī,” kūnū balisagīlwa ū mhayo gwabo gūkūshikīīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bing'we mutabonaga shakoolechiwa sha nyalomolomo na kūfunya būchūja bo kūlembagūla ūlū ng'wayūhaya, “Ū SEEBA alīhaya gīkī na gīkī alīyo natayombile?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya gīkī, Kūlwa mihayo ying'we ya nyalomolomo na shakoolechiwa sha kūlembagūla, nalī na wilwisha ning'we; alīhaya Seeba MULUNGU. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nkono gwane gūkwilwisha nabo a bahangi abo bakabonaga shakoolechiwa sha kūlembagūla na kūfunya būchūja bo nyalomolomo. Batūbiza mo ū mahooya ga banhū bane, nū mu kwihela kwa banhū ba numba ya Isilaeli batandīkwa mo, nūūlū gūgūlū gwabo gūtūkuumya ū mu sī ya Isilaeli. Hūna mukūdeeba gīkī ū nene nalī Seeba MULUNGU.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nguno bakabajimīījaga a banhū bane bakūmanagūhaya, ‘Mhola, nūūlū aho ītīho ī mhola; nūūlū yūzengwa ndugu īlelengetile bakībilaga swakala ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, bawīlage abo bakwībilaga swakala, gīkī īkūgwa! Nguno īkwiza mbula nhaale ya malambo, ya mawe na nyaga ntaale gūkūhembaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ndugu ūlū yūgwa batūbūūja a banhū, ‘Hama yaja he lūūlū ī swakala īyo ng'walī ng'wībilile?’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya gīkī, Nakūlekela nyaga ntaale kūlwa būpelanu bone, mu būdaki bone nakwenha mbula ya mawe, īkūtūla mbula nhaale ya malambo īleke būkenaagūji būtaale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ndugu īyo ng'wībilile swakala nakwīgwisha hasī īsambaale gete, ū nsingi gwayo gūkūpalūlwa. Ūlū yūgwa mukūshilīla mo na a bing'we; hūna mukūdeeba gīkī ū nene nalī SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ūmo nakūbūmalīla ū būpelanu bone ū kū ndugu, nū kū banhū abo bakwībilaga swakala. Hanuma nakūmuwīla gīkī, “Ī ndugu ītīho ī haha, na a babiji bayo ba swakala batīho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a bahangi ba Isilaeli abo bakwīhangīlaga ī Yelusalemu kūnū būbona na shakoolechiwa sha mhola kūlwa nzengo gwenūyo nūūlū aho ītīho mhola; alīhaya Seeba MULUNGU.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ng'wana wa munhū, bahangīlage a bashīke ba banhū bako, abo bakahangaga kūfuma mu maganiko gabo dūhū; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūbawīle gīkī, “Ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya, Balī mu kwihīga a bakīma abo bakabungaga mhīgī mu tūbogooshi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13:18",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Tūbogooshi:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, bakasumaga tūbogooshi twa kūbungīla mhigi.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " bayūjitunga kū makono; na kūbeeja shitambaala sha būlī mbika sha kwifīkīja kū mitwe, gīkī bayūbakenaagūla",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13:18",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Bayūbakenaagūla:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, bayūbagwasha.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " a banhū bane. A bing'we mukwikala mukūkenaagūlaga",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13:18",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mukūkenaagūlaga:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, mukūgwashaga.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " būpanga wa banhū bane dūhū alīyo ū wing'we wikale mhola? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukwenhelejaga nayūsondagūlwa mu banhū bane kūlwa kwanukūla tūbūsīga twa mheela mu lūpī, na tūlūgūkūlū twa ngatī. Mukūbalembagūlaga abo bakadegelekaga ya būlomolomo, ng'wayūbabūlaga abo batigeleelilwe kūcha, ng'wabaleka abo batigeleelilwe kwikala mhola.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Alilūūlū ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya gīkī, Natatūtogilwe ū tūbogooshi twing'we twa mhīgī, ūto mukabagwasījaga banhū gītī noni. Nakūtūhulumūla nang'wīngīje ū kū makono ging'we, nabataligūle a banhū abo mukūbagwashaga gītī noni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nī shitambaala shing'we nakūmutandagūja nabīnje a banhū bane ū mu makono ging'we. Bīnge ū mu būsese bo kwikala ha sīlīlī ya būdūla wing'we hangī. Hūna mukūdeeba gīkī ū nene nalī SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bing'we mukūbagwishaga ng'holò a batūngīlīja kūlwa būlomolomo wing'we, nūūlū aho nataalī kūbenhela ya kūbapīnīhaja. A babūbi mukūbinhaga lūgiili giili, baalemeelwa ū kūgalūka bīnge ū mu nzīla jabo ī jabūbi gīkī bipīje ū būpanga wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
